cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AssureKit, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "AssureKit: open-source release assurance for FinTechs and credit unions"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ian
    family-names: Diakonov
    affiliation: "Malikan Inc."
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
  - name: "Malikan Inc."
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikan/assurekit"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AssureKit tests the application, its data and its AI together in one
  automated release pipeline and turns the results into evidence mapped to
  AI risk frameworks used in financial services.
keywords:
  - software testing
  - quality assurance
  - AI evaluation
  - synthetic data
  - financial services
  - credit unions
